  "note": "IP-05-T01 publishes the projection boundary contract only: profile_id, context_kind, projection_epoch, and projection_revision are mandatory partition and fence fields on every projection record and IP-04 handoff, and no producer or host may substitute a synthetic or default identity. Snapshot acquisition, canonicalization, revision ordering, duplicate and gap handling, profile isolation, atomic replacement, and recovery are later IP-05 tasks, so this artifact states no ordering or recovery outcome.",
  "outcome_note": "IP-02 projection outcomes are the authoritative boundary result for a record input. IP-07 owns the wire mapping for any boundary failure.",
